   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Good job, Vitka.' Max talks to the chef in a tender dream.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Витюшенька, мой огузок.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Vityushenka, my little runt.' Dreaming that he is the boss of Chef Barinov.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Ты что, совсем с ума сошёл?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Have you completely lost your mind?' Viktor Barinov roars in shock and anger.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Ты что здесь спишь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why are you sleeping here?' Demanding an immediate explanation from the rookie.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Шеф, простите меня, пожалуйста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Chef, please forgive me.' Max wakes up in total fear.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я прилёг на пять минут.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
