   "t": "'I lay down for five minutes.' Trying to downplay his unauthorized nap.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "На кухне спать нельзя!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
